{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38019","headline":"三月二十七日自抚州往南城县舟行见拂水蔷薇因有是作 · 韩偓","name":"三月二十七日自抚州往南城县舟行见拂水蔷薇因有是作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江中春雨波浪肥，石上野花枝叶瘦。\n枝低波高如有情，浪去枝留如力鬬。\n绿刺红房战褭时，吴娃越艳醺酣後。\n且将浊酒伴清吟，酒逸吟狂轻宇宙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}